<div id="hw-article-author-popups-node-5859493--21300234637" style="display: none;"><div class="author-tooltip-0"><div class="author-tooltip-name">Peter H. Yoon </div><div class="author-tooltip-affiliation"><span class="author-tooltip-text"><div class='author-affiliation'><span class='nlm-sup'>1</span><span class='nlm-institution'>Anthropic</span>, San Francisco, CA, <span class='nlm-country'>USA</span></div></span></div><ul class="author-tooltip-find-more"><li class="author-tooltip-gs-link first"><a href="/lookup/google-scholar?link_type=googlescholar&amp;gs_type=author&amp;author%5B0%5D=Peter%2BH.%2BYoon%2B" target="_blank" title="Open in new tab" class="" data-icon-position="" data-hide-link-title="0">Find this author on Google Scholar</a></li><li class="author-tooltip-pubmed-link"><a href="/lookup/external-ref?access_num=Yoon%20PH&amp;link_type=AUTHORSEARCH" target="_blank" title="Open in new tab" class="" data-icon-position="" data-hide-link-title="0">Find this author on PubMed</a></li><li class="author-site-search-link"><a href="/search/author1%3APeter%2BH.%2BYoon%2B" rel="nofollow" class="" data-icon-position="" data-hide-link-title="0">Search for this author on this site</a></li><li class="author-orcid-link last"><a href="http://orcid.org/0000-0002-9156-1393" target="_blank" title="Open in new tab" class="" data-icon-position="" data-hide-link-title="0">ORCID record for Peter H. Yoon</a></li></ul></div><div class="author-tooltip-1"><div class="author-tooltip-name">Januka S. Athukoralage </div><div class="author-tooltip-affiliation"><span class="author-tooltip-text"><div class='author-affiliation'><span class='nlm-sup'>1</span><span class='nlm-institution'>Anthropic</span>, San Francisco, CA, <span class='nlm-country'>USA</span></div></span></div><ul class="author-tooltip-find-more"><li class="author-tooltip-gs-link first"><a href="/lookup/google-scholar?link_type=googlescholar&amp;gs_type=author&amp;author%5B0%5D=Januka%2BS.%2BAthukoralage%2B" target="_blank